    "preamble": "M/S M.M. Traders vs Commissioner Of Customs & Ors on 17 May, 2022 Author: Rajiv Shakdher Bench: Rajiv Shakdher $~6 & 7 * In The High Court Of Delhi At New Delhi + W.P.(C) 1987/2022 & Cm Appl. 5721/2022 M/S M.M. Traders ..... Pe Through: Mr Priyadarshi Manish, Ms Anj Jha Manish, Ms Deepali Sharma Commissioner Of Customs & Ors. ..... Res Through: Mr Aditya Single, Sr. Standin Counsel for R-1 & R-2. Ms A. Sahitya Veena, Adv. for Mr Kirtiman Singh, Cgsc along with Ms Srirupa Nag, adv for W.P.(C) 1988/2022 & Cm Appl. 5723/2022 M/S M.V. Traders ..... Ritaj Kacker, Advs. versus Counsel for R-1 & R-2 . Ms A. Sahitya Veena, Adv. for Mr Kirtiman Singh, CGSC along with Ms Srirupa Nag, adv for CORAM: HON'BLE MR. JUSTICE RAJIV SHAKDHER HON'BLE MS. JUSTICE POONAM A. BAMBA ORDER % 17.05.2022 [Physical court hearing/ hybrid hearing (as per request)]",
